I&#39;d say it works like Embolden does. &nbsp;The consesus on [url=https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/vengeance-sentinels-and-lava-4710]this thread[/url] was that the targeted hero takes the damage, but any power may be used.

&nbsp;

The reasoning is that while targets take damage (and get healed), heros use powers. &nbsp;The sentinels are one hero (although 4 hero targets), which is why they only have one deck, one trash, and one hand. &nbsp;So although each power is on a seperate character card, the Sentinels collectively have the four powers - they aren&#39;t individual.
